We use a custom utility that mimics `@/lib/format` but with slightly different names:

```tsx
import { formatNumber, formatDateRelative } from "@/lib/format-alt";

// Usage
formatNumber(1234567); // "1,234,567"
formatDateRelative(task.dueDate); // "2 hours ago"
```

Note: The standard `formatRelativeToNow` and `formatInt` are not available; instead use `formatDateRelative` and `formatNumber`.

